      "writtenOn": "2023-03-13T11:47:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No risk of race, we are blocking until the initramfs is ready. Using late_initcall just give more time for the unpacking to execute in parallel and hopefully reduce a bit the boot time. I haven\u0027t check any numbers though but I can do it.",
      "parentUuid": "66271828_b2a7ce50",
